WEBVTT

00:04:58.684 --> 00:05:02.518
To avoid this trap, Beauvoir advised
loving authentically,

00:05:02.518 --> 00:05:04.937
which is more like a great friendship.

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:07.933
Lovers support each other 
in discovering themselves,

00:05:07.933 --> 00:05:09.767
reaching beyond themselves,

00:05:09.767 --> 00:05:13.463
and enriching their lives
and the world together.

00:05:13.463 --> 00:05:16.558
Though we might never know
why we fall in love,

00:05:16.558 --> 00:05:20.548
we can be certain that it will be
an emotional rollercoaster ride.

00:05:20.548 --> 00:05:22.259
It's scary and exhilarating.

00:05:22.259 --> 00:05:23.257
It makes us suffer

00:05:23.257 --> 00:05:25.145
and makes us soar.

00:05:25.145 --> 00:05:26.667
Maybe we lose ourselves.

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:28.238
Maybe we find ourselves.

00:05:28.238 --> 00:05:29.724
It might be heartbreaking,

00:05:29.724 --> 00:05:32.557
or it might just be 
the best thing in life.